1356 26B-5-703. Purpose -- Duties -- Reporting.
1360 (1) The purpose of the commission is to be the central authority for coordinating behavioral health
initiatives between state and local governments, health systems, and other interested persons, to
ensure that Utah's behavioral health systems are comprehensive, aligned, effective, and efficient.
